COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_delegation_begin_chat(text, text, text, integer, integer) IS 'Service-only: admits one OMNI web chat reply for a chat:write owner delegation after verified owner, owner AI approval, released Emergency Stop, 30/day limit and the shared evolution-omni guard; audited; stores metadata only; confers no tool, task, approval or execution authority.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_delegation_check_chat(text, text, uuid) IS 'Service-only: request-bound re-check of a running delegated chat reply (delegation, owner AI approval, Emergency Stop); grants nothing.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_delegation_finish_chat(uuid, text, integer, integer, integer, integer, integer, text, text, integer, text) IS 'Service-only: records a delegated chat outcome and releases or keeps (as an owner-review pause) only that run''s own AI guard; audited.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_delegation_fusion_plan_gate(text, text) IS 'Service-only: checks a fusion:plan owner delegation and the Emergency Stop and logs the request; answers planner not_available; cannot create, read, start or hand off tasks, call models, touch permits or caps, or engage/release the Emergency Stop.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_fusion_plan_ready() IS 'Install marker for migration 0067 (fusion:plan scope). No data.';
COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.omni_delegated_chat_ready() IS 'Install marker for migration 0066 (chat:write scope). No data.';
